Third-party components redistributed with iFinBrain
----------------------------------------------------

@file-viewer/* (File Viewer, Flyfish Dev) — Apache-2.0
    iFinBrain bundles the @file-viewer preset-office / renderer-* npm packages
    for the document preview pipeline (PDF, Word, Excel, PowerPoint, OFD, iWork,
    WordPerfect, Hangul). Per Apache-2.0 section 4(d), their attribution notice
    is preserved verbatim in frontend/LICENSE-NOTICE and their license text in
    frontend/LICENSE-APACHE-2.0. Both files must be retained in any distribution
    or derivative work.

    Upstream: https://github.com/flyfish-dev/file-viewer
              https://gitee.com/flyfish-dev/file-viewer-core

All other third-party dependencies retain their own licenses. The complete
dependency tree and each package's declared license are recorded in
frontend/package-lock.json; the JVM dependency tree is resolvable from
backend/pom.xml.
